              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/smooth+spaces"} smooth spaces
              we consider
              = succeed "." do
                %a{:href => "#GStructureAndCartanGeometry"} below
          %p
            In view of the above, it is immediate that in order to generalize
            = succeed "," do
