                    %mo →
                    %mi X
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \ast \to \mathbb{D}_x \to X
              of that point is the further
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/pullback"} pullback
              of the infinitesimal disk bundle to this point:
            .maruku-equation
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "block", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
