            %li
              %p
                %em
                  %a{:href => "#CohomologyOfSuperMinkowskiSpacetime"} Cohomology of super Minkowski spacetime
          %h4#DeRhamComplexOfSuperDifferentialForms Super differential forms
          %p
            Recall from def.
            = succeed ":" do
              %a.maruku-ref{:href => "#SuperCartesianSpace"}
          %p
            A
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/super+Cartesian+space"} super Cartesian space
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %msup
                    %mi ℝ
                    %mrow
                      %mi p
                      %mo{:stretchy => "false"} |
                      %mi q
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \mathbb{R}^{p|q}
            is the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/formal+dual"} formal dual
            of the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/commutative+superalgebra"} commutative superalgebra
          .maruku-equation
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "block", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %msup
                    %mi C
                    %mn ∞
                  %mo{:stretchy => "false"} (
                  %msup
                    %mi ℝ
                    %mrow
                      %mi p
                      %mo{:stretchy => "false"} |
                      %mi q
                  %mo{:stretchy => "false"} )
                  %mo ≔
                  %msup
                    %mi C
                    %mn ∞
                  %mo{:stretchy => "false"} (
                  %msup
                    %mi ℝ
                    %mi p
                  %mo{:stretchy => "false"} )
                  %msub
                    %mo ⊗
                    %mi ℝ
                  %msup
                    %mo ∧
                    %mo •
                  %msup
                    %mi ℝ
                    %mi q
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"}
                  C^\infty(\mathbb{R}^{p|q})
                  \\coloneqq
                  C^\infty(\mathbb{R}^p)\otimes_{\mathbb{R}}\wedge^\bullet \mathbb{R}^q
          %p
            in that a smooth function
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %msup
                    %mi ℝ
                    %mrow
                      %msub
                        %mi p
                        %mn 1
                      %mo{:stretchy => "false"} |
                      %msub
                        %mi q
                        %mn 1
                  %mo ⟶
                  %msup
                    %mi ℝ
                    %mrow
                      %msub
                        %mi p
