                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} (x^a, \theta^\alpha)
            be the canonical
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/coordinates"} coordinates
            on the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/super+Minkowski+spacetime"} super Minkowski spacetime
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %msup
