                    %mo{:stretchy => "false"} )
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} (D,p)
              a
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Fierz+identity"} Fierz identity
              implies that the term
            .maruku-equation
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "block", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
