              as such, see there.
          %p
            Traditional literature that involves super-Cartan geometry more or less explicitly and in the context of
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/supergravity"} supergravity
            and its
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/supergravity+torsion+constraints"} supergravity torsion constraints
            includes
          %ul
            %li#Baaklini77a
              %p
